224 0 obj
<<
/Title (During my internship at Schneider Electric's Switchgear Design and Development Center, I worked on a project to create a Door Interlock System for the draw-out EOM Module door. This system aimed to enhance safety by preventing the door from opening until the isolated position was reached, while also allowing for a temporary defeat feature for testing purposes. When the door was opened in this state, it would self-lock upon closure. Additionally, the system enabled a smooth draw-out of the EOM Module and prevented users from resetting any features after reinsertion.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 26 0 R
/Next 384 0 R
>>
endobj
